  "answer_text": "Here is how you can log in to your **My Service Canada Account (MSCA)**:\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udd17 Direct Login Link\n\n\ud83d\udc49 **[Click here to Sign In to My Service Canada Account (MSCA)](https://www.canada.ca/en/employment-social-development/services/my-account.html)**\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udd11 Sign-In Options\n\nThere are several ways to log in to MSCA:\n\n1. **GCKey**\nGCKey allows you to access multiple Government of Canada online services.\n\n2. **Interac\u00ae Sign-In Partner**\nInterac\u00ae Sign-In Partner allows you to register or sign in using your online banking sign-in information to access MSCA.\n\n3. **Provincial Sign-In (Alberta & BC only)**\nYou can access My Service Canada Account (MSCA) by signing in or registering with your provincial sign-in, however this service is only available for residents of Alberta and British Columbia.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcdd Need to Register?\n\nIf you don't have an account yet, you can create one at: \ud83d\udc49 **[Create My Service Canada Account](https://www.canada.ca/en/employment-social-development/services/my-account/registration.html)**\n\nBy clicking \"Start your registration,\" you will be able to create a GCKey username and password if you don't already have one.\n\n---\n\n## \u26a0\ufe0f Important Reminder\n\nYou must access and use MSCA only as yourself \u2014 no one is authorized to use or create an account on your behalf.\n\n---\n\nIf you're having trouble logging in, you can also call **Service Canada at 1-800-206-7218** for assistance.",
